    Bug 230899 - Disable write-only 'X-Mozilla-News-Host' header and remove related code. r=mkmelin


    While the `X-Mozilla-News-Host' header is still added when a newsgroup posting is created, it isn't effectively evaluated anywhere, the news server is determined solely by the chosen identity ('X-Identity-Key' header).

    In a next step, the `nntpService.generateNewsHeaderValsForPosting` function should be fixed.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D236917

